<title>USA: Connetquot CSD, N.Y., $19 mln TANs sold.</title>
<headline>Connetquot CSD, N.Y., $19 mln TANs sold.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fleet Securities and First Albany won portions of a $19 million Connetquot Central School District, N.Y., tax anticipation note (TANs) offering.</p>
<p>Fleet won $10 million with an net interest cost (NIC) of 3.9027 and a coupon of 4.50 percent.</p>
<p>First Albany Corp won $9 million with an NIC of 3.9359 percent and a coupon of 4.50 percent.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
